  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=AandH XPointMute Control-AHM64 r0.0\\\\Controls Input to Zone, and||1
  Cmn2=Zone to Zone mutes.\\\\Parameters:\\ Input ControlType: 	Select||1
  Cmn3=Input, Zone or Group.\\ Input ControlChnl: 	Select valid range from||1
  Cmn4=control type in decimal format.\\ Output ControlType: 	Select Input,||1
  Cmn5=Zone or Group.\\ Output ControlChnl: 	Select valid range from control||1
  Cmn6=type in decimal format.\\\\Inputs:\\ Digital-\\  MuteOn/Off/Toggle:
  Cmn7=||1Pulse to turn mute on/off or toggle state.\\	Poll: Pulse to poll||1
  Cmn8=the current Mute. Should only be needed for initial \\			reading||1
  Cmn9=of Mute at code start and after recalling a preset. \\\\ Serial-
  Cmn10=\\  FmMixer: Connect to the TCP/IP symbol receive line.\\\\Outputs:
  Cmn11=\\ Digital-\\  MuteOnFb/OffFb: Mute Feedback. This is tracked internally\\
  Cmn12=||3by the module. It is also updated when the mixer sends\\   feedback||1
  Cmn13=when the control is nudged.\\\\ Serial-\\  ToMixer: Connect to the||1
  Cmn14=TCP/IP symbol Transmit line.\\\\Notes:\\ Reference the AHM64 protocol||1
  Cmn15=for valid Control Channels for the\\  selected control type.\\\\
  Cmn16=||1For more information Reference: AHM-TCP-Protocol-V1.pdf\\\\ Tested||1
  Cmn17=with AHM64 Firmware V1.02 - Rev59154\\\\ Release: 2020-Nov-19 Release||1
  Cmn18=r0.0\\
[END]
